MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#   Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#   before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# ── .NET / WinUI 3（v2.0.1 主线：winui/ 应用 + core/ 数据层 + tests/ 单测）──
# ⚠️ 上面的 `*.manifest` 是 Python/PyInstaller 规则，会把 WinUI 的
#    winui/app.manifest 一起吃掉（csproj 里 ApplicationManifest 指向它，
#    必须入库），所以这里显式加回。
!winui/app.manifest
